%description:
Light downlink traffic over RLC AM on a gNB with two narrow carriers is delivered in full: a UE
served on both carriers in one slot gets each carrier's data in that carrier's MAC PDU, also
when its RLC entity has nothing to send for one of the carrier's requests.

One gNB on two carriers of 6 bands each, and four UEs in front of it, each with an acknowledged
mode bearer. From 0.1 s to 0.8 s the server sends each UE 2000 bytes every 20 ms; a packet does
not fit the bands of one carrier, so a UE is scheduled on both, and the RLC entity is often asked
for data it does not have (an empty buffer, or a segment that does not fit). The run goes on to
1 s so that the queues drain.

Checked: the run ends at its time limit, and each UE receives every byte sent to it, 72 000
bytes. (When the gNB MAC waited for an answer to each of its requests and the RLC sent none,
the PDUs of a later slot took that slot's SDUs, and the run aborted on an occupied H-ARQ
process.)

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.NrSessionTestNetwork
sim-time-limit = 1s

*.numUe = 4
*.*.app[*].**.scalar-recording = true
**.numBands = 6
*.carrierAggregation.numComponentCarriers = 2
*.carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[0].carrierFrequency = 2GHz
*.carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[1].carrierFrequency = 3.5GHz
*.gnb.cellularNic.numCarriers = 2
*.gnb.cellularNic.phy.componentCarrierModules = "carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[0] carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[1]"
*.ue[*].cellularNic.nrPhy.componentCarrierModules = "carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[0] carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[1]"
*.bearerConfigurator.onDemandDrbs = [{coreNetwork: "5gc", isDefault: true, suppressSdapHeader: true, lcg: 3, rlcMode: "AM"}]

# downlink: server.app[i] to ue[i].app[0]
*.server.numApps = 4
*.ue[*].numApps = 1
*.server.app[*].typename = "CbrSender"
*.server.app[*].destAddress = "ue[" + string(ancestorIndex(0)) + "]"
*.server.app[*].destPort = 1000
*.ue[*].app[0].typename = "CbrReceiver"
*.ue[*].app[0].localPort = 1000
*.*.app[*].packetSize = 2000B
*.*.app[*].startTime = 0.1s
*.*.app[*].finishTime = 0.8s
*.server.app[*].samplingTime = 20ms

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 0
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Simulation time limit reached
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: results/General-#0.sca
scalar NrSessionTestNetwork.ue[0].app[0] cbrReceivedBytes:sum 72000
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: results/General-#0.sca
scalar NrSessionTestNetwork.ue[1].app[0] cbrReceivedBytes:sum 72000
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: results/General-#0.sca
scalar NrSessionTestNetwork.ue[2].app[0] cbrReceivedBytes:sum 72000
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: results/General-#0.sca
scalar NrSessionTestNetwork.ue[3].app[0] cbrReceivedBytes:sum 72000
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
